<title>USA: Navistar International Corp Q4 Oct 31 loss.</title>
<headline>Navistar International Corp Q4 Oct 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.10   profit	 $0.66</p>
<p> Net	  loss	    nil   profit	56,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,451,000		1,772,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,700		   74,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 net income before $7.0 million in preferred dividends vs $7.0 million a year ago.</p>
